  "content": {
    "id": "p32-q1-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Express each fraction in its simplest form.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{a^2+ab}{ab}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{a+b}{b}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^2+ab}{ab}&=\\frac{a(a+b)}{ab}\\\\\\frac{a^2+ab}{ab}&=\\frac{a+b}{b}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2+xy}{x^2-xy}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+y}{x-y}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+xy}{x^2-xy}&=\\frac{x(x+y)}{x(x-y)}\\\\\\frac{x^2+xy}{x^2-xy}&=\\frac{x+y}{x-y}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{a^2-b^2}{(a+b)^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{a-b}{a+b}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^2-b^2}{(a+b)^2}&=\\frac{(a-b)(a+b)}{(a+b)^2}\\\\\\frac{a^2-b^2}{(a+b)^2}&=\\frac{a-b}{a+b}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{b^2-1}{b^2-b}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{b+1}{b}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{b^2-1}{b^2-b}&=\\frac{(b-1)(b+1)}{b(b-1)}\\\\\\frac{b^2-1}{b^2-b}&=\\frac{b+1}{b}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2-y^2}{(x-y)^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+y}{x-y}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-y^2}{(x-y)^2}&=\\frac{(x-y)(x+y)}{(x-y)^2}\\\\\\frac{x^2-y^2}{(x-y)^2}&=\\frac{x+y}{x-y}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{3x^2-3xy^2}{x^2+xy}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3(x-y^2)}{x+y}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x^2-3xy^2}{x^2+xy}&=\\frac{3x(x-y^2)}{x(x+y)}\\\\\\frac{3x^2-3xy^2}{x^2+xy}&=\\frac{3(x-y^2)}{x+y}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2+6x+8}{x^2-4}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+4}{x-2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+6x+8}{x^2-4}&=\\frac{(x+2)(x+4)}{(x-2)(x+2)}\\\\\\frac{x^2+6x+8}{x^2-4}&=\\frac{x+4}{x-2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{a^2+a-6}{2a+6}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{a-2}{2}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^2+a-6}{2a+6}&=\\frac{(a+3)(a-2)}{2(a+3)}\\\\\\frac{a^2+a-6}{2a+6}&=\\frac{a-2}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2-8x+15}{x^2+2x-35}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x-3}{x+7}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2-8x+15}{x^2+2x-35}&=\\frac{(x-3)(x-5)}{(x+7)(x-5)}\\\\\\frac{x^2-8x+15}{x^2+2x-35}&=\\frac{x-3}{x+7}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-j",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "j",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^2+x-2}{x^2-1}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x+2}{x+1}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+x-2}{x^2-1}&=\\frac{(x+2)(x-1)}{(x-1)(x+1)}\\\\\\frac{x^2+x-2}{x^2-1}&=\\frac{x+2}{x+1}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-k",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "k",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{2x^2-7x+3}{(2x-6)^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{2x-1}{4(x-3)}$\n\nSplit the middle term to factorise the numerator, then cancel a common factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x^2-7x+3&=2x^2-6x-x+3\\\\2x^2-7x+3&=2x(x-3)-(x-3)\\\\2x^2-7x+3&=(2x-1)(x-3)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2x^2-7x+3}{(2x-6)^2}&=\\frac{(2x-1)(x-3)}{4(x-3)^2}\\\\\\frac{2x^2-7x+3}{(2x-6)^2}&=\\frac{2x-1}{4(x-3)}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 58
      },
      {
        "id": "p32-q1-l",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "l",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{3x^2+5xy-2y^2}{4x^2+7xy-2y^2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{3x-y}{4x-y}$\n\nSplit the middle terms and group to factorise both quadratics, then cancel the common factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2+5xy-2y^2&=3x^2+6xy-xy-2y^2\\\\3x^2+5xy-2y^2&=3x(x+2y)-y(x+2y)\\\\3x^2+5xy-2y^2&=(3x-y)(x+2y)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}4x^2+7xy-2y^2&=4x^2+8xy-xy-2y^2\\\\4x^2+7xy-2y^2&=4x(x+2y)-y(x+2y)\\\\4x^2+7xy-2y^2&=(4x-y)(x+2y)\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3x^2+5xy-2y^2}{4x^2+7xy-2y^2}&=\\frac{(3x-y)(x+2y)}{(4x-y)(x+2y)}\\\\\\frac{3x^2+5xy-2y^2}{4x^2+7xy-2y^2}&=\\frac{3x-y}{4x-y}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 82
      }
    ]
  },
